  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁϥϣⲉ **ⲉⲃⲟⲗ** ϩⲓⲧⲟⲧϥ .",
      "english": "He then departed from him.",
      "source": "Life of Shenoute - part 1",
